# Bundled ONNX models (generated by scripts/export_backbones.py, distributed via PyPI)
# ONNX backbones. mobilenet_v3_small ships in the wheel -- 4.0MB total, and it is
# what makes inference work without torch at all (#36). resnet18 is 44.8MB and
# stays out of git: generate it with scripts/export_backbones.py if you want it.
src/adaptshot/data/*.onnx
src/adaptshot/data/*.onnx.data
!src/adaptshot/data/mobilenet_v3_small.onnx
!src/adaptshot/data/mobilenet_v3_small.onnx.data

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs & Benchmarks (keep templates, ignore runtime)
logs/*.log
benchmarks/results/

# MkDocs build output (deployed to gh-pages by CI, never committed to main)
/site/
/.cache/

